  "id": "short-grit-scale",
  "term": "Short Grit Scale",
  "definition": "The Short Grit Scale is a brief 8-item assessment used to measure grit, a noncognitive personal quality involving passion and perseverance in pursuing long-term goals. It evaluates two parts of grit: consistency of interests over time and perseverance of effort when facing challenges.",
